  "title": "The Saturday Selection, Vol. 129",
  "summary": "Defining Indie, a retired Iger, trash can wheel rims, and much more.",
  "content": "<p><em>Every day, WITI’s group chats buzz with fresh links. As part of our Saturday send for paid readers, we round up 11 of the best.</em></p><p><em>It’s WITI, on the weekend</em><strong>.</strong></p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qZlw!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F96f1887d-65a4-4321-8888-5951f86c075d_4896x3672.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qZlw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F96f1887d-65a4-4321-8888-5951f86c075d_4896x3672.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" alt=\"File:Sufjan Stevens, April 2016.jpg - Wikimedia Commons\" title=\"File:Sufjan Stevens, April 2016.jpg - Wikimedia Commons\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><strong>Why are these interesting? </strong></p><p><a href=\"https://pitchfork.com/story/what-is-indie-rock-we-asked-33-artists-labels-and-critics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">What Is Indie Rock? We Asked 33 Artists, Labels, and Critics</a> (<em>Pitchfork</em>)</p><p>A fun add-on to Pitchfork’s new <a href=\"https://pitchfork.com/story/the-100-best-indie-rock-albums-of-all-time/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Best Indie Rock Albums of All Time</a> list.</p><p><a href=\"https://trashcanwheelrims.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Trash Can Wheel Rims</a> (<em>TCWR</em>)</p><p>Exactly what it sounds like. </p><p><a href=\"https://www.readfeedme.com/p/your-favorite-substacks-talent-agency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Your favorite Substack’s talent agency just got acquired</a> (<em>Feed Me</em>)</p><p>With the purchase of Brigade, a small talent firm, Substack writers and podcast hosts are now managed by the same company as movie stars.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.fieldmag.com/articles/return-of-galibier-footwear-brand-profile?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Behind The Revival of an Iconic French Outdoor Brand</a> (<em>Field Mag</em>)</p><p>World, re-meet Galibier.</p>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://whyisthisinteresting.substack.com/p/the-saturday-selection-vol-129\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>",
